            <div type="edition" xml:lang="tam-Latn" rendition="class:tamil maturity:83215">
                
                <p>
                    <lb n="1"/>tir<choice><sic>u</sic><corr>i</corr></choice>-puvaṉa-c-cakkara-va<reg>r</reg>tti kō-<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice>ēriṉmai koṇṭāṉ jayaṅ-koṇṭa-cōḻa-vaḷa-nāṭṭu muḻaiyūr-nāṭṭu-t tiru-naḷḷāṟ-uṭaiyār kōyilil tē<supplied reason="lost">va</supplied>r kaṉmikku<choice><sic>mm</sic><corr>m</corr></choice> c<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>-māyēśvara-k-kaṇk<unclear>ā</unclear>ṇi ceyvārkaḷukkum <hi rend="grantha"><unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">śrī</unclear></hi>-kāriyañ ceyvāṉukkum It-tēvarkku-t tiru-maṭai viḷākamamum tiru-nantavaṉamum Uḷḷiṭṭu vēṇṭuva<hi rend="check">ṉaṉu</hi>yiṟṟukku-t tiru-naḷḷāṟ-āṉa virutarā<hi rend="grantha">ja</hi>-payaṅkara-c-caruppēti-maṅkalattu-p piṭākai tirunaḷḷāṟṟu nilattu-c cāttaciyarkku-p pati<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> āṟāvatu Aḷavil n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkal-āka n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>kkiṉa Ūr nattattukku mē<unclear>l ēṟṟam</unclear>-āka pa <gap reason="lost" quantity="5" unit="character" precision="low"/>
                    <lb n="2" break="no"/>r nattam-āka-t ceyta nila<unclear>t</unclear>tu It-tēvar tiru-maṭai viḷākattukku-c cērvāṉa  nilamum kaṭalāṭu tiru-v<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ti-y-āka-c ceyta nilamum vātucey vāraṇaṉ tiru-na<supplied reason="omitted">n</supplied>tavaṉattukkum civamati tiru-nantavaṉattukkum tiru-nāvukkaraiciṉ tiru-na<supplied reason="omitted">n</supplied>tavaṉattukkuc cērvāṉa nilamum Uḷpaṭa n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>r-nilam Iraṇṭ’ araiyē mūṉṟu mā<unclear reason="eccentric_ductus" >vu</unclear>m kollai nilam Iraṇṭē-y ēḻu mā<unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">vu</unclear>m pati<choice><orig>ṉṉ</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> āṟāvatu Aḷak<unclear>ka</unclear>-k kuṟainta nilatt’ ōpāti nilam m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>ṉṟu mā mukkāṇiyum Āka nilam Aiñ cēy  m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>ṉṟu mā mu<unclear>k</unclear>kāṇiyum Aiñc-āvatu mutal It-tēvarkku-t tēvatāṉa Iṟai-y-ili-y-āka Iṭṭu muṉṉuṭaiyārum paḻam <supplied reason="lost">p</supplied><unclear>e</unclear>
                    <lb n="3" break="no"/>rum Iṟai-kaṭṭu-k kuṭal-āy varu<supplied reason="lost">ki</supplied>ṟa paṭiyum tavirntu n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkalukku Uṭal-āka n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>kki variyilārum varikkuk kūṟu ceyvārkaḷum Eḻutt-iṭṭa Uḷvari tara-c coṉṉōm
                </p>
                <p>                    
                    Iṉ-ṉilam Aiñc-āvatu mutal It-tēvarkku-t tēvatāṉa-Iṟai-y-ili-y-āy n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkalukku Uṭal-āka kai-k koṇṭu Aṉupavikka Eḻutiṉāṉ <choice><sic><unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">ni</unclear></sic><corr>ti</corr></choice>ru-man<choice><sic>n</sic><corr>t</corr></choice>ira Ōlai I <gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="character"/> āciriya-p-pallavaraiyaṉ                    
                </p>	
                
                <p>
                    <list>
                        <item>Ivai vayirāka-rāyaṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai vilāṭa-rāyaṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>yāṇṭuḷ <num value="13"><g type="numeral">10</g> 3</num> <g ref="sym:bar" type="punctuation">.</g><g ref="sym:bar" type="punctuation">.</g><g ref="sym:bar" type="punctuation">.</g><g ref="sym:tam-pillaiyarCuli" type="punctuation">.</g></p> 
                
                <p>Uḷ virippaṭi yāṇṭu 5 <g ref="sym:tam-nal" type="ideogram">@</g> <num value="10"><g type="numeral">10</g></num> <g ref="sym:dash-long" type="punctuation">.</g></p>
                
                <p>tēvatāṉa y-iṟaiyiliyāka Iṭṭu n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkal-āka n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>kkiṉa paṭikku Uḷvari jayaṅ-koṇṭa-cōḻa-vaḷanāṭṭu muḻaiyūr-nāṭṭu-t tiru-naḷḷāṟ-Uṭaiyāṟkku-t tiru-maṭai-viḷākamum tiru-na<supplied reason="omitted">n</supplied>tavaṉamum Uḷ<supplied reason="lost">li</supplied>
                    <lb n="4" break="no"/>ṭṭu vēṇṭuvaṉavaiyiṟṟukku muṉpu nīṅkalāy varukiṟa nilattukku mēl Ēṟṟam-āka-t tiru-naḷḷāṟ-āṉa virutarājapayaṅkara-c-caruppēti-maṅkalattu-p piṭākai tiru-naḷḷāṟṟu viṭukiṟa nilattukku Ūr-k-kaṇakkut tiru-naḷḷāṟ-uṭaiyāṉ kaṇakkuppaṭi nilamāy muṉṉuṭaiyārum paḻam pērum Iṟai kaṭṭu-k kuṭal-āy varukiṟa paṭiyun tavirntu yāṇṭu Aiñc-āvatu mutal tēvatāṉa-Iṟai-y-ili-y-āka Iṭṭu n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkal-āka n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>kkiṉa Uṭaiyār cuṅkan <supplied reason="lost">ta</supplied>vir<supplied reason="omitted">t</supplied>ta cōḻa-tēvarkku patiṉ āṟāvatu Aḷavil n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkal-āka n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>kkiṉa Ūr-nattattukku mēl Ēṟṟam-āka-p piṉpu Ūr-nattam-āka-c ceyta nilattu It-tēvar tiru-maṭai-viḷāka
                    <lb n="5" break="no"/>-c cērvāṉa nilamum tiru-k-kaṭalāṭu tiru-v<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ti-y-āka-c ceyta nilamum vātucey vāraṇaṉ tiru-na<supplied reason="omitted">n</supplied>tavaṉattukkum civaṉmati <unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">ti</unclear>ru-nantavaṉattukkum tiru-nāvukkaraicaṉ <choice><sic>n</sic><corr>t</corr></choice>iru-nantavaṉattukkum cērvāṉa nilamum <hi rend="check">2 <g type="numeral">10</g> va ya</hi> 
                </p>
                <p>
                    <choice><sic>ni</sic><corr>In</corr></choice>-nilam Iraṇṭ’ araiyē m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>ṉṟu mā kollai nilam Iraṇṭē-y Ēḻu māvum Āka nilam
                </p>
                <p>                    
                    Aiy-vēlikku patiṉṉ āṟ-āvatu Aḷakka-k kuṟainta nilatt’ ōpāti nilam m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>ṉṟu mā mu-k-kāṇiyum Āka nilam Aiñ-cēy m<choice><orig>u</orig><reg>ū</reg></choice>ṉṟu mā mu-k-kāṇi<supplied reason="omitted">yi</supplied>ṉāl nila<supplied reason="omitted">m</supplied> Opāti paḻaviṟai <g ref="sym:tam-kalam" type="ideogram">@</g> <hi rend="check">3 <g type="numeral">100</g> 2 <g type="numeral">10</g> 1 <g type="numeral">100</g> 3</hi> 
                    
                    niccayitta Opāti <g ref="sym:tam-kalam" type="ideogram">@</g> <hi rend="check"><gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="character"/> <g type="numeral">100</g> 2 <g type="numeral">10</g> 9 3 <gap reason="lost" quantity="2" unit="character"/></hi> kku-p patiṉ āṟ-āvatu Aḷanta paṭi n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkal n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>kki nilam Ai-v-vēlikku-p <surplus>p=</surplus>patt’ oṉpat-āvatu niccayitta <g ref="sym:tam-kalam" type="ideogram">@</g> <hi rend="check">2 <g type="numeral">100</g> 2 <g type="numeral">10</g> 5 <gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="character"/></hi> kku paṭṭ’ aḷanta Opāti n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>r nilattukku ni<unclear>c</unclear>
                    <lb n="6" break="no"/>cai<supplied reason="omitted">yitta</supplied> Opāti ni<unclear>la</unclear>m kollai nilattukku-k kollai varicai Opātiyum Ūr-<supplied reason="omitted">ni</supplied>lattukkum paḻa Iṟai <g ref="sym:tam-kalam" type="ideogram">@</g> <hi rend="check">2 <g type="numeral">100</g> 2 <g type="numeral">10</g> 5 <gap reason="lost" quantity="3" unit="character"/><!--fractions--> <g ref="sym:tam-nilam" type="ideogram">@</g> <gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="character"/></hi> niccayitta <g ref="sym:tam-kalam" type="ideogram">@</g> <hi rend="check"><g type="numeral">100</g> 5 <g type="numeral">10</g> 5 <gap reason="lost" quantity="2" unit="character"/><!--fractions--></hi> Eḻup=patt’ oṉpat-āvatu niccayitta <g ref="sym:tam-kalam" type="ideogram">@</g> <hi rend="check"><g type="numeral">100</g> 5 <g type="numeral">10</g> 7 <gap reason="lost" quantity="3" unit="character"/><!--fractions--></hi> m yāṇṭu Aiñc-āvatu mutal tēvatāna Iṟai-y-ili-y-<supplied reason="lost">ā</supplied>ka Iṭṭu n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>ṅkal-āka n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>kkiṉamaikku
                </p>
                <p>
                    <list>
                        <item>Ivai puravari c<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>-karaṇattu mukaveṭṭi Aruṅ-kuṉṟa-nūḻi<unclear>y</unclear>āṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai puravari c<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>-karaṇattu mukaveṭṭi Ālaṅkuṭaiyāṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai puravari <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-karaṇa-nāyakam koṟṟa-maṅkalam-uṭaiyāṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai puravari <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-karaṇattu mukaveṭṭi pullāli Uṭaiyāṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai puravari <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-karaṇa-nāyakam marutūr-<choice><sic>a</sic><corr>u</corr></choice>ṭai<unclear>y</unclear>āṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai puravari <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-karaṇa <gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/>
                            <lb n="7" break="no"/>ḻalūr-uṭaiyāṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai ciṅkaḷa-rāyaṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai n<choice><orig>i</orig><reg>ī</reg></choice>la-kaṅkaraiya<choice><orig>n</orig><reg>ṉ</reg></choice> Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai puravari śrī-karaṇa-nāyakam ciṟu-paṉṉūr kiḻavaṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai IrāIrāca viḻupparaiyaṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai nikarili cōḻa-p-pallavaraiyaṉ <supplied reason="omitted">E</supplied>ḻuttu </item>
                        <item>Ivai paṅkāḷa-rāyaṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai puravari <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-karaṇa-mukaveṭṭi nel-kuṉṟaṅ kiḻāṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai maḻava-rāyaṉ Eḻuttu</item>
                        <item>Ivai kurukula-rāyaṉ Eḻu<supplied reason="omitted">t</supplied>tu</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                
